[ti:Day 24]

[00:00.00]cubicle 例 I like to decorate my cubicle with pictures of my family and friends. 我喜欢用家人和朋友 的照片装饰我的办公隔间。
[00:09.27]veracity 例 The veracity of the statistics is questioned by all of the staff. 这组数据的真实性受到了所有 员工的怀疑。
[00:18.25]couture 例 He left Dior in 1961 and opened his own couture house, financed by Berge, in 1962. 他 于1961年离开迪奥品牌，并于1962年在伯格的资 助下创办了自己的时装店。
[00:28.95]bias 例 She goes to great effort to prompt her neighbour to shed his bias. 她努力使她的邻居 摆脱偏见。
[00:37.36]foreclose 例 Only through the help of a friendly lawyer did they escape foreclosure. 在一位友善的律师 的帮助下，他们才避免了丧失抵押品赎回权。
[00:47.34]canvass 例 We have well-established channels of distribution, so we can canvass the retailers directly, without any middlemen. 我们有良好的 销售渠道，所以可以不通过任何中间商直接向零 售商推销。
[01:02.75]accrue 例 The monthly finance charges will accrue if you do not pay off your credit card debt before the payment termination date. 如果你没 有在每月的还款日之前还清你的信用卡欠款，每 个月的信贷费用就会自然增长。
[01:18.01]enclose 例 I will enclose an order sheet for the dictionaries and a cheque for 100 dollars with the letter. 我会随信附上一张词典订购单和一张 100美元的支票。
[01:30.41]redundant 例 As the economy weakens, more and more people will be made redundant from their jobs. 经济形势持续低迷，越来越多的人将面临失业。
[01:41.82]stereotype 例 He doesn't fit the stereotype of a successful businessman. 他不太符合成功商人 的既定形象。
[01:50.52]parkland 例 The building is surrounded by five acres of parkland. 那栋楼周围是五英亩的开阔草地。
[01:58.22]forecast 例 One thing we cannot do very well is to forecast the economy. 预测经济走向这件事我们 无法做得很好。
[02:06.49]arouse 例 You arouse their interest by telling them that you're the right person for the position and by promising to help them achieve their mission. 告诉对方你是该职位的最佳人选，同时 承诺帮助他们实现目标，这样便能引起对方的兴 趣。
[02:24.18]quarantine 例 All of these imported animal products have to be quarantined for two weeks when they reach China. 这些进口动物产品抵达中国后都必 须接受两周的检疫隔离。
[02:37.30]exempt 例 Travel expenses are exempt from income tax. 差旅费无须缴纳个人所得税。
[02:43.57]apt 例 Expense allowances are apt to mean fiddling. 开销津贴容易造成弄虚作假。
[02:49.56]mislay 例 He often mislays different products. 他经常 把不同的产品放错位置。
[02:55.12]fire 例 Her boss threatened to fire her. 老板威胁要 开除她。
[02:59.69]bureau 例 The Census Bureau says birthrates have dropped in every area of the world except Africa. 人口普查局称除了非洲之外，世界各地的 出生率近来已有所下降。
[03:11.24]leverage 例 If you don't do this, you will miss the opportunity to create leverage. 如果你不这样 做，你将会失去制造影响力的机会。
[03:20.94]entrepreneurial 例 Entrepreneurial culture is part of the entrepreneurial management. 企业文化是企业 管理的一部分。
[03:31.63]vicinity 例 There is a store in the immediate vicinity of the station. 车站附近就有一家商店。
[03:39.76]benefit 例 If the new team can find innovative ways to enhance employees' enthusiasm, the benefits are manifold. 如果新团队能找到新途径来提高员 工的工作积极性，会带来多方面的好处。
[03:53.17]orbit 例 Housing prices have gone into orbit this year. 今年的房价已经涨到极点了。
[03:59.59]cede 例 The Fed should cede responsibility for the micro management of American banks. 美联储 应该放弃对美国各大银行的微观管理。
[04:09.86]remunerate 例 The company has not yet remunerated my overtime payments. 公司还没有付给我加班费。
[04:18.41]dependence 例 An increasing dependence on outside contractors has contributed to heightened danger at these plants. 对外部承包商的日益依 赖增加了这些工厂的危险。
[04:32.53]upshift 例 The futures industry is expecting an upshift in the coming years. 期货行业有望在未来几年内 有所起色。
[04:41.52]clutter 例 The buttons not only slow down your computer, but also create visual clutter. 这些 图标不仅使你的电脑变慢，还会造成视觉杂乱。
[04:51.93]variance 例 Both sides are at variance on what measures to be taken. 双方在采取何种措施的问 题上有意见分歧。
[04:59.77]teleworking 例 The system of teleworking can help reduce office operating expenses. 在家办公制度有助于 降低办公运营成本。
[05:09.90]mount 例 As job rejections mount up, they are beginning to feel alarmed. 随着被拒绝次数的增 加，他们对找工作开始担忧了。
[05:18.31]curve 例 What information is needed to derive the production possibility curve of each country? 在推导每个国家的生产可能性曲线时需要哪些资 料？
[05:29.72]elite 例 We grouped an elite team for the onsite support for the new product. 我们为新产品组建 了精英团队，提供现场支持。
[05:38.56]referral 例 I made a referral of this young woman to our department. 我把这位年轻女士介绍到了我们 部门。
[05:46.41]carriage 例 The railway carriage became so hot that air misted up the windows. 火车车厢里变得很热， 使车窗蒙上了一层水汽。
[05:55.53]fray 例 Only at this stage did biotech supporters enter the fray, denouncing the decision as a triumph of politics over science. 只有在这个阶 段，生物技术的支持者才参与到争论中来，谴责 这个决定是政治压倒了科学。
[06:10.65]end-consumer 例 We see it that competition is really healthy for the end-consumer. 我们认为，对于最终消 费者来说，竞争确实有好处。
[06:20.49]shelve 例 The plan has to be shelved due to lack of money. 由于资金紧缺，不得不将计划搁置。
[06:26.91]underline 例 They invited many experts to train its employees and underlined again and again the importance of this project. 他们邀请了许多专家 对员工进行培训，并再三强调了该项目的重要 性。
[06:41.74]multiply 例 This will multiply our chances of success. 这将会增加我们成功的机会。
[06:48.16]unanimous 例 After a lengthy discussion they reached an unanimous decision on the marketing strategies. 经过长时间的讨论，他们就营销策略 问题达成了一致意见。
[07:00.71]ambiguity 例 The convention results in no ambiguity. 这 个协定不会导致误解。
[07:06.98]counteract 例 We have to reduce our prices to counteract the dollar effect. 我们不得不通过降价来抵消美 元的影响。
[07:15.83]stakeholder 例 Some salesmen are so afraid of getting shot down that they wait for clients to come to them rather than cold calling. 一些销售人员 害怕遭到打击，就不去主动推销，坐等客户自己 送上门。
[07:31.23]appreciate 例 They failed to appreciate the significance of the precautions. 他们没有意识到这些预防措 施的重要性。
[07:40.50]crop 例 A green manure is a crop grown mainly to improve soil fertility. 种植绿肥作物主要是为使土 壤更加肥沃。
[07:48.77]capricious 例 The stock market is so capricious that investors had better think thoroughly before action. 股票市场行情变幻莫测，投资者一定要三 思而后行。
[08:01.46]alternate 例 The amount of time needed for these tasks will vary and perhaps it would be better to alternate them each weekend to lessen the workload. 所有这些工作所耗费的时间是不确定 的，或许最好能在每个周末轮换下这些工作以减 少工作量。
[08:19.00]abide 例 We are keen on foreign investment so long as foreign firms abide by the market rules and our country's constitution. 只要外企遵守市场规 则和我国宪法，我们热烈欢迎外商投资。
[08:33.69]bail 例 He repudiated the court's decision to offer bail. 他不接受法庭的保释裁决。
[08:40.40]ponder 例 You'd better ponder over the means for raising funds before the project starts. 你们最 好在项目开始之前考虑好各种集资的途径。
[08:50.95]component 例 During schema evolution, any component of a schema can change from one version to the next. 在模式演化过程中，模式的任何成分都可能 随着版本的不同而变化。
